roceedings, including in Member States, with competent jurisdiction\"; \"Advocating for the agency and support of victims and survivors\"; \"Developing possible strategies for future accountability processes\u201d and so on and in the same breath, also talks about \u201cHow to support?\u201d It will be good to note what it states under \"How to support?\" I quote:"
