oing to attend that Summit. You must avail yourself of the opportunity to demonstrate that Sri Lanka takes BIMSTEC seriously. You must put the house in order to be able to initiate, follow up and coordinate effectively all BIMSTEC activities. It is time to make our Foreign Service think innovatively and come up with practical and meaningful proposals in consultation with relevant ministries, agencies and experts, which could enrich BIMSTEC's output and its quality of service."
