    "chunk_text": "Sir, the United Nations has condemned the airstrikes as violations of international law and demanded civilian protection. A few western countries and Saudi Arabia have urged for a ceasefire and have affirmed their com-mitment to jointly leading efforts to ensure that a two-State solution is vigorously pursued. Even the Arab League and the OIC have done the same. But, there is a catch here, Sir. For a two-State solution to be of any rele-vance at all, first and foremost, Israel should be denied legitimacy for its relentless campaign aimed to \u201ccreate facts on the ground\u201d. Sadly, it is on this point that some otherwise influential Arab countries, unfortunately, in-cluding the UAE and Turkey, need to do more beyond mere exhortations. Countries including Jordan, Egypt, Qatar, Saudi Arabia, Turkey and Iran have condemned Israeli attacks, labelling them as war crimes and urging an immediate ceasefire. Sir, it is absolutely shocking, how-ever, that the United States continues to back Israel de-spite global calls for restraint. President Trump got finan-cial and military assistance worth US Dollars 18 billion approved in an effort to enable Israel to finish its \u201cunfinished job\u201d. In a comment that outraged the con-science of humanity, he stated publicly that the United States would take over and develop Gaza as a \u201cRiviera of the Middle East\u201d. This drew in widest possible protest from the Arab and Islamic world and from other quarters as well.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dc0\u0db1\u0ddd \u0d9c\u0dc0\u0db1\u0dca\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bae\u0bae\u0ba9\u0bc6\u0bbe \u0b95\u0bae\u0ba3\u0b9a\u0ba9\u0bcd) (The Hon. Mano Ganesan) Anyway, Gaza is not for sale.\n\nWhen we stood accused relating to the final phase of the war in Puthumathalan and Mullivaikkal, the entire international community was urged by western countries and many others, even our diaspora, to take action against us. Now, we also have to conscientiously stand up against\n\n3455 3456\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dae\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0db8\u0dca\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0"
