    "language": "si-ta-en",
    "md5": "730b306375f03e29ba45d61ba5572c06",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2103,
    "chunk_text": "Therefore, some views that have been spread over social media and the ideas expressed by some people that we have not taken appropriate action are not true; we have taken action. With regard to this particular situation, we have to understand that it is not a situation between only two countries, but a global situation. By the United States, a standard formula has been applied and there is no room for any country to proactively negotiate and get a concession. I will give you two examples. One is India. India went to the United States and had certain discussions about these tariffs, but still their reciprocal tariff rate is 26 per cent. That is, 50 per cent of the trade deficit divided by its total imports of US Dollars 85 billion.\n\nNow, I want to give some summarized answers for the other questions on market diversification. So, apart from these tariffs -\n\n\u0dbb\u0dc0\u0dcf8\u0dbb\u0dc0\u0dd38\u0dae\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0dda\u0dcf\u0d85\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dae8\u0dcf\u0dd4\u0dcf\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bb0\u0bb5\u0bbf \u0b95\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0ba3\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95) (The Hon. Ravi Karunanayake) Hon. Deputy Speaker, let me seek a clarification so that he would be able to summarize the -\n\n\u0dbb\u0dc0\u0dcf8\u0db1\u0dd2\u0db8\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u0dca\u200d\u0dba8\u0dae\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0d85\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dae\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dcf\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bcd \u0bc6\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Deputy Speaker) Could you please wait till the Hon. Minister finishes?\n\n\u0dbb\u0dc0\u0dcf8\u0dc0\u0d86\u0da0\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dba) 8\u0d85\u0db1\u0dd2\u0dbd\u0dca 08\u0da2\u0dca\u200d\u0dba\u0db1\u0dca\u0dcf8\u0dcf\u0dd4\u0dcf\u0dcf8 (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 (\u0b95\u0bc8\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bbf) \u0b85\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0b9c\u0baf\u0ba8\u0bcd\u0ba4) (The Hon. (Dr.) Anil Jayantha) Yes, first, let me finish; I will finish quickly.\n\nApart from these measures, as far as the export market is concerned, we have already explored and are still exploring possible market diversifications. We are especially looking for opportunities under GSP Plus in the European region and also possibilities under UK's DCTS. Even in China, the Middle East, India and in other South Asian countries, there are also various possibilities. In addition, we also can enter into special trade agreements as well."
  },
